Infinigen (Princeton Vision & Learning Lab)
  https://github.com/princeton-vl/infinigen
  SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause

  Used, not vendored.  `src/buildingsgen/stairs/infinigen_backend.py` imports
