Generation snapshot (generation/)

  Scripts published verbatim from the workspaces that generated the buildings;
  generation/MANIFEST.json records each file's origin and SHA-256.  They call,
  without vendoring:
    MolmoSpaces (Allen Institute for AI)   source scenes and object packages,
        https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/molmospaces -- downloaded at run
        time; no scene or asset is redistributed here.
    Infinigen (BSD-3-Clause) and Blender `bpy` (GPL-2.0-or-later)
        staircase synthesis.
    NVIDIA Isaac Sim                       PhysX validation and RTX rendering.
    NVIDIA ProtoMotions (Apache-2.0)       simulator geometry modules, imported
        at run time and not included in generation/.
